@RemoteMonitoring.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### 获取所有设备列表
GET {{RemoteMonitoring.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices
Accept: application/json

### 获取指定设备状态
GET {{RemoteMonitoring.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/CNC-001/state
Accept: application/json

### 获取设备历史数据
GET {{RemoteMonitoring.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/CNC-001/history?count=10
Accept: application/json

### 健康检查
GET {{RemoteMonitoring.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json
